---
import { siteConfig } from '../config';
---
<section id="hero" class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> ZHICONG LIANG / PORTFOLIO 2026</p>
      <p class="hello">你好，我是梁志聪。</p>
      <h1>让AI，<br />用在<span class="highlight">具体的问题</span>上。</h1>
      <p class="hero-intro">深圳大学生物医学工程本科生。<br class="desktop-break" />我做AI工具、搭网站，也把实践方法讲给同学和同事。</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button primary" href="#projects">看看我的作品 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/profile.html">一页个人简介 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-tags"><span>AI应用开发</span><span>技术教学</span><span>医工融合</span></div>
    </div>
    <a class="hero-feature" href="#project-02" aria-label="了解课堂作品互评平台">
      <div class="feature-top"><span><i class="status-dot"></i> 我的课堂工具</span><span class="mono">PROJECT 02 ↗</span></div>
      <div class="feature-title">从“做出来”，<br />到“有人用”。</div>
      <div class="feature-window">
        <div class="window-bar"><span class="window-dots">● ● ●</span><span>HTML作品互评台</span></div>
        <img src="/assets/classroom.png" width="1100" height="350" alt="课堂作品平台首页实景" fetchpriority="high" />
      </div>
      <div class="feature-bottom"><div><strong>38</strong><span> 件作品</span></div><div><strong>359</strong><span> 条反馈</span></div><span class="feature-caption">真实课堂里的<br />展示、试玩与交流</span></div>
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="container hero-bottom"><span>从问题出发，做出原型，再到真实场景里验证。</span><a href="#projects">往下看 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
</section>
